<title>UK: SOCCER-ENGLISH PREMIER MATCH SUMMARY.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-ENGLISH PREMIER MATCH SUMMARY.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-11-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Summary of Wednesday's English premier league match:</p>
<p>Liverpool 1 (Robbie Fowler 30th minute) Everton 1 (Gary Speed 82). Halftime 1-0. Attendance: 40,750.</p>
</text>
